            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "business of a nature that cannot be scheduled on any nonduty day. Personal leave will be granted only when the immediate supervisor determines that adequate provisions for continuing the school program can be made. In cases of emergency, the appropriate school official shall be notified prior to the start of the duty day to be taken off.",
